    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just being gentle with myself. it's like... the spark is gone. the thing that made me *me* was that movement, that precision. now i'm just walking around in a broken machine that doesn't serve any purpose. it feels more like a burden than a life, honestly. just dragging this useless body around.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
