      "content": "It is heartbreaking to feel that vital spark extinguished, especially when your identity was so deeply intertwined with your abilities. The feeling of your body becoming a burden when it no longer meets your former expectations is a heavy weight to carry. Could you perhaps explore small ways to find a sense of purpose or engagement that doesn't rely on that specific kind of peak physical performance? Even tiny shifts in focus can begin to help rekindle a sense of self beyond the sport.",
      "source": "target",
